hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"18986","al-Fadl ibn Dukayn narrated to us, Sharik narrated to us, from Abu Jafar al-Farra, he said: I heard Abu Umayyah al-Fazari, he said: I saw the Messenger of Allah, peace and blessings of Allah be upon him, being cupped, and Abu Nuaym once did not say al-Farra. Abu Jafar said: And he did not say al-Farra."
